Nethack works just fine under Desqview--I play under it all the time.  One
of my favorite uses for DV and NHack is to dredge down into the dungeon while
I'm downloading a file in another window.

As for your problem...simple, you just don't have  an ansi driver loaded in
that particular Desqview window.  Try running DVANSI.COM (in your DV directory,
obviously), and everything will work just beauty.

